! Simple 2-variant twinned crystal
0.0 8.886 0.0    !reciprocal lattice point (nm^-1)
0.70711 -0.70711 0.0    !lattice vector (nm)
0.70711 0.70711 0.0    !lattice vector (nm)
0.0 0.0 1.0    !lattice vector (nm)
1    !# of atoms in a unit cell
0.0 0.0 0.0    !reduced coordinates of atom #1
1    !phase ID
100.0 0.0    !form factor of atom #1
0.0 0.0 0.0    !P -> shift coefficient (none in this example)
0.0 0.0 0.0    !P -> shift coefficient (none in this example)
0.0 0.0 0.0    !P -> shift coefficient (none in this example)
